{
  "mn120:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 120 ",
  "mn120:0.2": "Saṅkhārupapattisutta ",
  "mn120:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn120:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn120:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn120:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn120:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn120:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn120:2.1": "“saṅkhārupapattiṁ vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi, ",
  "mn120:2.2": "taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasi karotha, bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
  "mn120:2.3": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn120:2.4": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn120:3.1": "“Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu saddhāya samannāgato hoti, sīlena samannāgato hoti, sutena samannāgato hoti, cāgena samannāgato hoti, paññāya samannāgato hoti. ",
  "mn120:3.2": "Tassa evaṁ hoti: ",
  "mn120:3.3": "‘aho vatāhaṁ kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā khattiyamahāsālānaṁ sahabyataṁ upapajjeyyan’ti. ",
  "mn120:3.4": "So taṁ cittaṁ dahati, taṁ cittaṁ adhiṭṭhāti, taṁ cittaṁ bhāveti. ",
  "mn120:3.5": "Tassa te saṅkhārā ca vihārā ca evaṁ bhāvitā evaṁ bahulīkatā tatrupapattiyā saṁvattanti. ",
  "mn120:3.6": "Ayaṁ, bhikkhave, maggo ayaṁ paṭipadā tatrupapattiyā saṁvattati. ",
  "mn120:4-5.1": "Puna caparaṁ, bhikkhave, bhikkhu saddhāya samannāgato hoti, sīlena samannāgato hoti, sutena samannāgato hoti, cāgena sam